## Named-role agents available

For multi-agent work, the starter pack ships seven role personas in [`agents/`](agents/) plus the original savant-reviewer:

- **`product-owner`** — reads discovery material, writes user stories with sources
- **`architect`** — reads stories + code, produces structural-fitness analysis
- **`developer`** — per-story gap analysis + sprint plan
- **`frontend-builder`** — builds the next UI iteration end-to-end with verification
- **`ux-critic`** — Nielsen + WCAG + interactive task-flow walkthrough
- **`business-controller`** — financial-control reviewer simulation
- **`domain-reviewer`** — parameterised domain-expert reviewer (compliance / ethics / scientific peer)
- **`savant-reviewer`** — uncompromising code-quality review (Identify → Replace → Test)

Dispatch via Claude Code's `Agent` tool with `subagent_type: "<name>"`.

---

## File locations

- Checkpoints: `~/.claude/checkpoints/<repo>/`
- Skills: `~/.claude/skills/<name>/SKILL.md`
- Hooks: `~/.claude/hooks/<name>.sh` (registered in `~/.claude/settings.json`)
- Agents: `~/.claude/agents/<name>.md`
